 [:db/cas 17592186120421 :question/problem "Which of the following matrices are upper triangular matrices?\n\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 7 & 11\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}].$" "Which of the following matrices are upper triangular matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 7 & 11\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}].$"]
