 [:db/cas 17592186120426 :question/problem "Consider the matrix\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$.\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. $A$ is upper triangular\n2. $A^{T} + A$ is upper triangular\n3. $A$ is lower triangular" "Consider the matrix\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$.\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $A$ is upper triangular\n- **II.** $A^{T} + A$ is upper triangular\n- **III.** $A$ is lower triangular"]
