 [:db/cas 17592186125018 :question/worked-solution nil "Graph I is strictly increasing. Graph II has a local minimum and maximum, graph III first decreases to a visible local minimum and then increases, and graph IV is a downward parabola. Thus II, III, and IV fail the horizontal line test; only I is invertible."]
