 [:db/cas 17592186129698 :question/problem "![](images/dc/dc2079e479351c8d0193961138aeb4dabd4689426c3e621668f314eb8445258f.png)\n\nThe graph of a polynomial $p(x)$ is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\n1. $x = 2$ is a root of even multiplicity.\n2. $x = ± 1$ are roots of odd multiplicity.\n3. $p(0) = 2$." "![](images/dc/dc2079e479351c8d0193961138aeb4dabd4689426c3e621668f314eb8445258f.png)\n\nThe graph of a polynomial $p(x)$ is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $x = 2$ is a root of even multiplicity.\n- **II.** $x = ± 1$ are roots of odd multiplicity.\n- **III.** $p(0) = 2$."]
